{"title":"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fifth and eighth terms of a geometric sequence of real numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce11f9bca5e74ba532323e045b62e2793d120b7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9370839bbb8a8037471714de7c7c5a52804b5a75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> respectively.  What is the first term?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9d35841e130f115b44c92328db73716d0cfe81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 60\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 75\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 120\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 225\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 315$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"414\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of the series be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495f96bd9e71dffc512f0370f4708797192b52f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar^{n-1}$\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.  Because\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4acfa5ec8bb1e8e6fc08dbc68222f4e3c6fa3a4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {8!}{7!} = \\frac {ar^7}{ar^4} = r^3 = 8,\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"39\" />\nit follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4bf9ecce9aa4520dc266d8e492bbf44fbacfd19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 2$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> and the first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364490180e78a9040a4075dffc113c90539c5494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac {7!}{r^4} = \\frac {7!}{16} = \\boxed{315}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"38\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a3faf1572d785ef1d5d72f120fb3a16190b4b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B\">2009 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" titl